 "sentences": [
  "A missile downed a passenger flight.",
  "On September 3, 1978, ZIPRA guerrillas hit an Air Rhodesia plane with a Soviet-made missile.",
  "The damaged aircraft attempted a belly landing in a cotton field.",
  "The plane cartwheeled and broke apart upon impact.",
  "Tragically, insurgents massacred 10 survivors found at the crash site.",
  "Only 8 people survived by hiding or searching for water."
